{# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   OEU M-CMD — the legacy-desk band.

   The four absorbed desks (gex, options_screener, flow_desk, flow_leaders) keep
   rendering at their own URLs for bookmarks and SEO — the house pattern is no
   page deletions and no redirect infrastructure. This slim band points each one
   at the mode of options.html that now carries it.

   Usage — one line per host page, BEFORE its first content wrapper:
     {% set oew_mode = 'ticker' %}{% include "_options_workspace_banner.html.j2" %}

   `oew_mode` ∈ brief | scanner | ticker | leaders (defaults to brief).
   `oew_prefix` — optional, for pages rendered one directory deep.

   Self-contained by design: its own t() macro (an {% include %} does not import
   the parent's macros) and its own scoped <style>, so it touches NO shared asset
   — not theme.css, not theme.js, not _navlinks.html.j2. Dismiss-free: there is
   no state to persist and nothing to remember.
   ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ #}
{% macro t(en, zh='') -%}
<span class="l-en">{{ en }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ zh if zh else en }}</span>
{%- endmacro %}
{% set _oewp = oew_prefix if (oew_prefix is defined and oew_prefix) else '' %}
{% set _oewm = oew_mode if (oew_mode is defined and oew_mode) else 'brief' %}
<style>
.oew-legacy{
  max-width:1240px; margin:0 auto 14px; padding:9px 16px;
  display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; flex-wrap:wrap;
  border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--line) 80%, transparent);
  border-left:2px solid #8e97c8;
  border-radius:10px;
  background:color-mix(in srgb, #8e97c8 7%, var(--panel));
  font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.45; color:var(--text);
}
html[data-theme="light"] .oew-legacy{
  border-left-color:#4c55a8;
  background:color-mix(in srgb, #4c55a8 6%, var(--panel));
}
.oew-legacy-txt{ color:var(--muted); }
.oew-legacy a{
  margin-left:auto; flex:none; font-weight:650; color:#8e97c8;
  text-decoration:none; white-space:nowrap;
}
html[data-theme="light"] .oew-legacy a{ color:#4c55a8; }
.oew-legacy a:hover{ text-decoration:underline; }
.oew-legacy a:focus-visible{ outline:2px solid #8e97c8; outline-offset:2px; border-radius:3px; }
@media (max-width:560px){ .oew-legacy{ margin-left:12px; margin-right:12px; } .oew-legacy a{ margin-left:0; } }
</style>
<div class="oew-legacy">
  <span class="oew-legacy-txt">{{ t('This desk now lives in the Options workspace — one page for the settled close.',
                                    '本面板已并入期权工作台 — 收盘后的统一页面。') }}</span>
  <a href="{{ _oewp }}options.html#{{ _oewm }}">{{ t('Open it there', '前往工作台') }} ↗</a>
</div>
